h3 Recent updates
row
  region "Placeholder: 32x32" 32x32
    rect @0,0 100x100 fill:#007bff
    text @50,50 "32x32" fill:#007bff size:18 anchor:middle
  text @username Some representative placeholder content, with some information about this user. Imagine this being some sort of status update, perhaps?
row
  region "Placeholder: 32x32" 32x32
    rect @0,0 100x100 fill:#e83e8c
    text @50,50 "32x32" fill:#e83e8c size:18 anchor:middle
  text @username Some more representative placeholder content, related to this other user. Another status update, perhaps.
row
  region "Placeholder: 32x32" 32x32
    rect @0,0 100x100 fill:#6f42c1
    text @50,50 "32x32" fill:#6f42c1 size:18 anchor:middle
  text @username This user also gets some representative placeholder content. Maybe they did something interesting, and you really want to highlight this in the recent updates.
